    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-canto</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum, 1,
				v. a.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To foretell</i>, <i>prophesy</i>
			(ante-class.), Lucil. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 102,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To enchant</i>, <i>bewitch</i>
			(postAug.), <i><span class="en">Petr. 131</span></i> (for <i><span class="en">Cic. Fin.
				2, 29, 94</span></i>, v. praecento.</div>
